abstract: >-
  Production-oriented CPython 3.13 language extensions for table-backed and
  optional native live switch dispatch, guarded specialization and partial
  evaluation, bytecode-level function inlining, and validated local goto,
  with fail-closed verification and reproducible performance evidence.
